OL,3,GNEWSAMercury's jacket sells on day he
OL,4,Awould have been 80
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jacket worn by rock legend Freddie
OL,7,FMercury during his last live singing
OL,8,Fperformance has sold for #85k on what
OL,9,Fwould have been his 80th birthday.
OL,11,FThe Queen star wore the cropped black
OL,12,Fjacket during a surprise guest
OL,13,Fappearance alongside Cliff Richard at a
OL,14,Fcharity gala at the Dominion Theatre in
OL,15,FLondon in April 1988.
OL,17,FWiltshire-based auctioneers Henry
OL,18,FAldridge & Son said a collector paid a
OL,19,Ftotal of #110,000 for the jacket at
OL,20,Fauction earlier, which included a
OL,21,Fbuyers' premium.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
