OL,4,Awould have been 80
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is a fantastic piece of showbiz
OL,7,Fhistory," said managing director Andrew
OL,8,FAldridge. He was one of the greatest
OL,9,Fshowmen of the 20th Century," he added.
